<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels are advancing in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning a housing project in Goma, while ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri. A WHO Ebola response team was trapped for over 24 hours near a hospital in Ituri and forced to shelter in a maternity ward, prompting WHO to call for evacuation. South African mercenaries have been captured in eastern DRC. Kenya and the DRC presidents have agreed to restore diplomatic ties after a meeting in Brazzaville. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/sudan/unhcr-iom-vulnerability-profiling-dashboard-october-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/south-sudan/unhcr-south-sudan-population-overview-refugees-and-asylum-seekers-31-october-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFAzNFFDc3pSbTNrVmFYdWcyUGxROWpkeEVkbUh6SVJvN3NFMmFHRjlpbW1rTnZHNzBySUFZRUllX2pXSWU5U0xLb0tueXBuUzgtV01KOHpBWU9OMlh1MWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPNTh6UEhmRFNqcUsxeUJFZDkxR2tkRVlDY3Q3akhsMHgzeXRVaHJRd09nMWpoTHpGVFBvdXMtUzByYllYajR1NHpPVElhalZzRmRTd0hHdnlUdmtkWU5EUUgzSS1XRzBxaVhzZ2hoSjBfQ3RyQnV5N1p0ckxSUHdOQmw1S1h4MWlLOE5PTUNHZFFKSkpLNGNkRnRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA0TmxPR0c1TURnTGJRNDVnQUZxRi1TQTBxdFAwRE1yZnZaUVdOZm5yb2UxLU5yZDBRLUlPY29uZllScy1td1gyWFZGU0Z3TzJsY09PV3djYkZub1BpMVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
